"l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan Trefler","x":"For example, we were delighted recently see that our client VIVAT, a meaningful Dutch insurance company, called out Pega actually in their annual report noting they, \"made good progress with automation and cost reduction, thanks to Pega.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/pegasystems-inc-pega-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PEGA 2019 Q1","e":"pega","d":"2019-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Stillwell","x":"We continue to see solid demand from companies engaging in digital transformation to improve customer experience and streamline their business processes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/pegasystems-inc-pega-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PEGA 2019 Q3","e":"pega","d":"2019-11-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Alan Trefler","x":"Now in terms of sort of insights on the market as you're aware we are seeing lots of disruptions around the world with things like Brexit and trade tariffs and our clients are looking at how to plan for any number of changes they may face.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/08/pegasystems-inc-pega-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PEGA 2019 Q3","e":"pega","d":"2019-11-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan Trefler","x":"As one analyst said in response to the recent layoffs of a major RPA vendor \"They're realizing that intelligent automation is a marathon not a sprint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/08/pegasystems-inc-pega-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PEGA 2019 Q3","e":"pega","d":"2019-11-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Stillwell","x":"So the professional services margin is something that will settle over time as opposed to being something that we would try to rightsize quarter-to-quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/08/pegasystems-inc-pega-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PEGA 2019 Q4","e":"pega","d":"2020-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan Trefler","x":"…services in the telecom sector becoming more commoditized, their intent on differentiating through superior, proactive and pre-emptive service to deliver those customer experiences increased our revenue and massively brought cost out of the business, exactly the type of initiative we seeded for.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/pegasystems-inc-pega-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PEGA 2020 Q1","e":"pega","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan Trefler","x":"And in less than three weeks, we're able to stand up a new mobile-friendly system to streamline the process, with a chatbot for additional support, and that system has already collected more than 750,000 application.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/pegasystems-inc-pega-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PEGA 2020 Q1","e":"pega","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan Trefler","x":"As stated in their procurement, Pega was selected because of our ability to provide a secure end-to-end integrated case processing solution to improve operational efficiency, streamline costs, and enhance taxpayer services in a highly configurable and flexible environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/pegasystems-inc-pega-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PEGA 2020 Q2","e":"pega","d":"2020-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Steve Enders","x":"I will pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/pegasystems-inc-pega-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PEGA 2020 Q2","e":"pega","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan Trefler","x":"We talked about the Pega Process Fabric, a new cloud-based software architecture designed to radically streamline how organizations to drive work across distributed enterprises, breaking down technology silos to unify work across an enterprise and help improve user experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/pegasystems-inc-pega-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"PEGA 2020 Q4","e":"pega","d":"2021-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan Trefler","x":"In our recently launched trademark, Pega Process Fabric, leaves together business processes, hence management and workloads to streamline the customer experience and improve employee productivity across the enterprise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/pegasystems-inc-pega-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PEGA 2020 Q4","e":"pega","d":"2021-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan Trefler","x":"Well, I'll tell you -- it's obviously hard to predict, but I think there will be sustainable cost savings because I think behavior has changed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/pegasystems-inc-pega-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PEGA 2021 Q1","e":"pega","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan Trefler","x":"I just expect that fewer people are going to access about the data center cost reduction, who knows, it's hard to predict that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/pegasystems-inc-pega-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PEGA 2021 Q2","e":"pega","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan Trefler","x":"Using a center-out approach, the latest enhancements help improve back-end process efficiencies, streamline front-end customer service processes and enable real one-to-one customer engagement to drive meaningful and lasting transformation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/pegasystems-inc-pega-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"PEGA 2021 Q2","e":"pega","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Rishi Jaluria",